{
  "about": [
    "Shared example data for the roll-up code. The web app and the MCP summaries test against the same file.",
    "listNodesResponse is a ListNodesResponse in the proto3 JSON mapping: all time, include_closed = true.",
    "The tree: Book (A) has the children Chapter 1 (B) and Chapter 2 (C). C is closed. Notes (D) is under B. Admin (E) is a root with no cycles.",
    "The Inbox is the node with no id. D2 is the running cycle (no minutes).",
    "now is Sunday 2026-11-01T20:00:00Z. America/Los_Angeles leaves daylight-saving time that day, so its day has 25 hours.",
    "Cycles A2, A3, and C2 start near midnight: they fall on different days or weeks in the two zones.",
    "doneCycles counts logged cycles. estimatedCycles adds the cycleCount of the estimates. Running cycles add no minutes and no count.",
    "own covers the node's own cycles and estimates. rolledUp adds all descendants. The Inbox enters no node's figures.",
    "Period totals cover logged cycles that started in [start, end), including Inbox cycles and cycles on closed nodes."
